other people think he did very bad things.

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:12.370
And I'm going to take a very good look at
it.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:13.370
OK.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:18.960
I mean, I I've I've seen people that are very
